# Build context is ./certbot (see docker-compose.prod.yml). Both of these are
# runtime material written on the host, never image content:
#   letsencrypt/   certs created by the running container as root (mode 700) —
#                  unreadable by the build user, which fails the context send
#   cloudflare.ini a real DNS-01 token (git-ignored) — never bake into an image
letsencrypt
cloudflare.ini
